格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"MCP Apps Host plugin for DeepSeek Harness: renders interactive HTML cards from MCP _meta.ui in sandboxed iframes, bridges postMessage to MCP tools/call and resources/read","id":"gh:1340857382","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-mcp-apps-host","slug":"oriliz/dsh-mcp-apps-host","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","mcp","mcp-apps"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"MCP Apps Host plugin for DeepSeek Harness: renders interactive HTML cards from MCP _meta.ui in sandb"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"oxed iframes, bridges postMessage to MCP tools/call and resources/read"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH MCP Apps Host"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"MCP Apps Host plugin for DeepSeek Harness. Connects to an MCP server that declares the `io.modelcont"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"extprotocol/ui` extension, preserves `_meta.ui` in tool results, renders interactive HTML cards in s"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"andboxed iframes, and bridges `postMessage` between cards and the MCP server."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Tool discovery with `_meta` preservation** — MCP tools registered with full `_meta.ui` payloads "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"intact\n- **Interactive HTML cards** — sandboxed iframe rendering with per-card CSP\n- **postMessage b"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ridge** — `ui/initialize`, `tools/call`, `resources/read`, `ui/update-model-context`, `ui/message`\n-"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" **Result replay notifications** — after the `ui/initialize` reply the host posts `ui/notifications/"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"tool-input` and `ui/notifications/tool-result` in FIFO order; new-spec cards ignore `lastToolResult`"},{"id":"p5s6","text":" and subscribe to these notifications only, so late-mounting cards (replay / injected sessions) stil"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"l restore the tool result\n- **Session ID injection** — automatically injects `session_id` into card-"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"initiated `tools/call`\n- **Invisible context injection** — `ui/update-model-context` context injecte"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"d as a plugin-sourced message via `agent.inject()`, classified as a collapsed context row (not a vis"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"ible user message bubble)\n- **HTTP bridge endpoint** — `/mcp-apps/<serverName>/bridge` for secure if"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"rame-to-MCP-server proxying (CORS-enabled for sandboxed cards that fetch it directly)\n- **Bridge deb"},{"id":"p5s12","text":"ug log** — `GET /mcp-apps/<serverName>/debug` returns the last 64 bridge exchanges; bridge calls byp"},{"id":"p5s13","text":"ass the agent pipeline and never reach the session JSONL, so this endpoint is the only place card-in"},{"id":"p5s14","text":"itiated `tools/call`s are observable\n- **Multi-instance safe** — each plugin instance registers its "},{"id":"p5s15","text":"own per-server bridge route, so several MCP Apps servers can coexist in one DSH profile\n- **stdio + "},{"id":"p5s16","text":"streamable-http** — supports both MCP transport types"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Demo"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"What a tool result carrying an embedded card looks like in the conversation:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The screenshot shows both cards of the bundled demo server (`demo/server.mjs` — zero dependencies, N"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"hows both cards of the bundled demo server (`demo/server.mjs` — zero dependencies, Node stdio only):"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- `demo_interactive` (**inline form**): the tool *result* carries `_meta.ui.resource.text`, so the c"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ard HTML rides the result. Its buttons exercise the full bridge round trip: a `tools/call` that refr"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"eshes the card (the host auto-injects `session_id`), and `ui/update-model-context` + `ui/message` ta"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"lking back to the model.\n- `demo_referenced` (**referenced form**): the tool *definition* carries `_"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"meta.ui.resourceUri` (`ui://demo/referenced-card`); the host resolves the HTML once via `resources/r"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ead` and inlines it. The card also demonstrates the bridge's `ui://` security gate — a `file:///etc/"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"passwd` read is refused."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Try it:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Not on npm yet — install from GitHub. The DSH host provides all `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` peer packages a"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"t runtime, so no peer install is needed:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### From source"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"All dsh peer packages resolve inside the deepseek-harness pnpm workspace, so build there (this also "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"matches the layout the bundled `lib/` was built in):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 1. Configure the connection"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Declare one plugin instance per MCP Apps server in your overlay (`serverName` picks both the tool pr"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"efix `mcp__<serverName>__*` and the bridge path `/mcp-apps/<serverName>/bridge`). A ready-to-edit te"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"mplate ships in `examples/connect-server.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`transport: streamable-http` with a `url` field is also supported."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 2. Start DSH"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 3. Verify"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Ask the agent to call one of your server's tools. The tool result renders as an interactive card ins"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ide the conversation instead of a plain result row — and the card's own buttons reach back to your s"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"erver through the bridge (`tools/call`, `resources/read`, `ui/message`). No server at hand? Use the "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ridge (`tools/call`, `resources/read`, `ui/message`). No server at hand? Use the bundled demo first."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Tool results flow left to right (server → tool registry → conversation → card), and card interaction"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"s loop back through the HTTP bridge to the server. Card HTML never enters the model context, and the"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" bridge only lets the iframe call tools registered on that server and read `ui://` resources."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Files"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| File | Role |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `src/index.ts` | Server-side: MCP connection, tool registration, HTTP bridge |\n| `src/client/McpAp"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"pCard.tsx` | Card component: iframe, postMessage handling |\n| `src/client/index.ts` | Client plugin:"},{"id":"p31s3","text":" slot registration, sendUserMessage |\n| `src/invariant.ts` | Cordis companion (no runtime invariant)"},{"id":"p31s4","text":" |\n| `demo/` | Zero-dependency demo server + protocol self-test + overlay |\n| `examples/` | Connecti"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"on overlay template |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Pitfalls Fixed"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| # | Issue | Fix |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| P0 | Server strips `_meta.ui` | Declare `mimeTypes` in client capabilities |\n| P1 | Card renders b"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ut shows no tool data | `presentationMeta()` wraps result as `CallToolResult`-shaped object |\n| P2 |"},{"id":"p36s3","text":" `session_id` injection fails | `readSessionId()` prefers `meta.lastToolResult.structuredContent` |\n"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"| P3 | External images blocked by CSP | `buildCsp()` adds `https:` to default `img-src` |\n| P4 | `ui"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"/update-model-context` was TODO | `_stagedContext` Map stores and prepends context |\n| P5 | Context "},{"id":"p36s6","text":"visible as user message text | `ui/inject-context` bridge injects via `agent.inject()` as plugin-sou"},{"id":"p36s7","text":"r message text | `ui/inject-context` bridge injects via `agent.inject()` as plugin-sourced message |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"See FINDINGS.md for detailed root cause analysis."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
